<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>deeptfolio — Calculadora de Inflación</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --burgundy-deep: #3D0F14;
            --burgundy-dark: #5C1A20;
            --burgundy: #7B2D35;
            --burgundy-mid: #8B3A42;
            --burgundy-light: #A84B52;
            --burgundy-pale: #C46B73;
            --gold: #C9A84C;
            --gold-light: #D4B96A;
            --gold-pale: #E8D5A0;
            --cream: #F5EDE4;
            --text-dark: #1A080A;
            --bg-dark: #1A0A0E;
            --bg-card: #2A1015;
            --success: #4A9E6E;
            --danger: #C45A5A;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--cream);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg-dark); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--burgundy); border-radius: 4px; }

        /* ===== NAVBAR ===== */
        .navbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.3);
        }

        .nav-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .nav-logo-icon {
            width: 36px; height: 36px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--burgundy), var(--gold));
            border-radius: 9px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--white);
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }

        .nav-logo-text {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--cream);
        }

        .nav-logo-text span { color: var(--gold); }

        .nav-back {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.6;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-back:hover { opacity: 1; color: var(--gold); }

        /* ===== HERO ===== */
        .hero {
            padding: 8rem 2rem 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 400px;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
            background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.15);
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--gold-pale);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .hero-title .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.5;
            max-width: 550px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* ===== CALCULATOR ===== */
        .calculator-section {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem 4rem;
        }

        .calc-card {
            background: rgba(42, 16, 21, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.25);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .calc-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
        }

        .calc-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .calc-inputs { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }

        .input-group { position: relative; }

        .input-label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }

        .input-label label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .input-label .info-tip {
            width: 18px; height: 18px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            cursor: help;
            position: relative;
        }

        .input-label .info-tip:hover::after {
            content: attr(data-tip);
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 130%;
            right: 0;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.3);
            padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            white-space: nowrap;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 1;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .input-field {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.25);
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: var(--cream);
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            outline: none;
        }

        .input-field:focus {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.1);
        }

        .input-field::placeholder {
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.25;
        }

        .input-prefix {
            position: absolute;
            left: 1.2rem;
            top: 2.65rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            opacity: 0.4;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .input-with-prefix {
            padding-left: 2.2rem;
        }

        /* Range Slider */
        .range-container {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .range-slider {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            appearance: none;
            width: 100%;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            background: rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.3);
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .range-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            appearance: none;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .range-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover {
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }

        .range-slider::-moz-range-thumb {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light));
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
        }

        .range-labels {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.35;
        }

        .range-value {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        /* Country Selector */
        .country-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .country-btn {
            padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.4);
            color: var(--cream);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .country-btn:hover {
            border-color: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
        }

        .country-btn.active {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.1);
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .country-btn .flag {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .country-btn .rate {
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            opacity: 0.5;
            display: block;
            margin-top: 0.15rem;
        }

        /* ===== RESULTS ===== */
        .calc-results {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .result-main {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.5);
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.15);
        }

        .result-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.4;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .result-value {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--gold);
            line-height: 1.2;
            transition: all 0.5s;
        }

        .result-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.4;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .result-details {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .detail-card {
            padding: 1rem;
            background: rgba(26, 10, 14, 0.4);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .detail-value {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .detail-value.loss { color: var(--danger); }
        .detail-value.gain { color: var(--success); }
        .detail-value.gold { color: var(--gold); }

        .detail-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.35;
        }

        /* Chart */
        .result-chart {
            height: 160px;
            position: relative;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .result-chart canvas {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        /* ===== SCENARIOS ===== */
        .scenarios-section {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem 4rem;
        }

        .section-label {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .section-label::before {
            content: '';
            width: 30px;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--gold);
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .scenarios-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .scenario-card {
            background: rgba(42, 16, 21, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.2);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .scenario-card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .scenario-card.active {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            background: rgba(42, 16, 21, 0.8);
        }

        .scenario-icon {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .scenario-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .scenario-rate {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .scenario-desc {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.4;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ===== FACTS ===== */
        .facts-section {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem 4rem;
        }

        .facts-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .fact-card {
            background: rgba(42, 16, 21, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.15);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .fact-icon {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-top: 0.1rem;
        }

        .fact-text h4 {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .fact-text p {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.45;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(123, 45, 53, 0.15);
        }

        .footer p {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--cream);
            opacity: 0.3;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: var(--gold);
            text-decoration: none;
            opacity: 0.5;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .footer a:hover { opacity: 1; }

        /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .calc-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .scenarios-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .facts-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .country-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
            .calc-card {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            .result-value {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .country-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .result-details {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        /* ===== ANIMATIONS ===== */
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .animate-in {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out both;
        }

        .delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
        .delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .delay-4 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }

        /* Number counter animation */
        @keyframes countPulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.03); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }

        .pulse { animation: countPulse 0.4s ease; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
            <div class="nav-logo-icon">d</div>
            <div class="nav-logo-text">deep<span>tfolio</span></div>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="nav-back">
            ← Volver al Portfolio
        </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-badge animate-in">
            📐 Herramienta Gratuita
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-title animate-in delay-1">
            Calculadora de <span class="highlight">Inflación</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle animate-in delay-2">
            Descubre cuánto perderá tu dinero con el paso del tiempo. 
            La inflación es el enemigo silencioso de tu patrimonio.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- SCENARIOS -->
    <section class="scenarios-section animate-in delay-2">
        <div class="section-label">Escenarios</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Selecciona un escenario o personaliza</h2>
        <div class="scenarios-grid">
            <div class="scenario-card active" onclick="selectScenario('conservative', this)">
                <div class="scenario-icon">🛡️</div>
                <div class="scenario-name">Conservador</div>
                <div class="scenario-rate">2% anual</div>
                <div class="scenario-desc">Inflación baja y estable, típica de economías desarrolladas</div>
            </div>
            <div class="scenario-card" onclick="selectScenario('moderate', this)">
                <div class="scenario-icon">⚖️</div>
                <div class="scenario-name">Moderado</div>
                <div class="scenario-rate">4% anual</div>
                <div class="scenario-desc">Inflación moderada, escenario más realista para la mayoría</div>
            </div>
            <div class="scenario-card" onclick="selectScenario('aggressive', this)">
                <div class="scenario-icon">🔥</div>
                <div class="scenario-name">Alta Inflación</div>
                <div class="scenario-rate">8% anual</div>
                <div class="scenario-desc">Escenario de crisis inflacionaria o economías emergentes</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CALCULATOR -->
    <section class="calculator-section">
        <div class="calc-card animate-in delay-3">
            <div class="calc-grid">
                <!-- INPUTS -->
                <div class="calc-inputs">
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <div class="input-label">
                            <label>Capital Inicial</label>
                            <span class="info-tip" data-tip="El dinero que tienes hoy">?</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="input-prefix">€</span>
                        <input type="text" class="input-field input-with-prefix" id="initialAmount" value="10,000" oninput="calculate()">
                    </div>

                    <div class="input-group">
                        <div class="input-label">
                            <label>Período</label>
                            <span class="info-tip" data-tip="Cuántos años en el futuro">?</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="range-value" id="yearsDisplay">10 años</div>
                        <div class="range-container">
                            <input type="range" class="range-slider" id="yearsSlider" min="1" max="50" value="10" oninput="updateYears(this.value)">
                            <div class="range-labels">
                                <span>1 año</span>
                                <span>25 años</span>
                                <span>50 años</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="input-group">
                        <div class="input-label">
                            <label>Tasa de Inflación Anual</label>
                            <span class="info-tip" data-tip="Porcentaje de inflación estimado">?</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="range-value" id="rateDisplay">4.0%</div>
                        <div class="range-container">
                            <input type="range" class="range-slider" id="rateSlider" min="0.5" max="20" step="0.1" value="4" oninput="updateRate(this.value)">
                            <div class="range-labels">
                                <span>0.5%</span>
                                <span>10%</span>
                                <span>20%</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="input-group">
                        <div class="input-label">
                            <label>País / Región</label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="country-grid">
                            <button class="country-btn active" onclick="selectCountry(this, 2.4, 'ES')">
                                <span class="flag">🇪🇸</span> España
                                <span class="rate">2.4%</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="country-btn" onclick="selectCountry(this, 3.2, 'US')">
                                <span class="flag">🇺🇸</span> EE.UU.
                                <span class="rate">3.2%</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="country-btn" onclick="selectCountry(this, 6.1, 'AR')">
                                <span class="flag">🇦🇷</span> Argentina
                                <span class="rate">6.1%</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="country-btn" onclick="selectCountry(this, 2.9, 'DE')">
                                <span class="flag">🇩🇪</span> Alemania
                                <span class="rate">2.9%</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="country-btn" onclick="selectCountry(this, 4.5, 'MX')">
                                <span class="flag">🇲🇽</span> México
                                <span class="rate">4.5%</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="country-btn" onclick="selectCountry(this, 3.4, 'BR')">
                                <span class="flag">🇧🇷</span> Brasil
                                <span class="rate">3.4%</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- RESULTS -->
                <div class="calc-results">
                    <div class="result-main">
                        <div class="result-label">Valor en poder adquisitivo</div>
                        <div class="result-value" id="resultValue">€6,570</div>
                        <div class="result-subtitle" id="resultSubtitle">en 10 años</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="result-details">
                        <div class="detail-card">
                            <div class="detail-value loss" id="lossAmount">-€3,430</div>
                            <div class="detail-label">Pérdida real</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="detail-card">
                            <div class="detail-value gold" id="lossPercent">-34.3%</div>
                            <div class="detail-label">Pérdida %</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="detail-card">
                            <div class="detail-value gold" id="halfLife">17.7 años</div>
                            <div class="detail-label">Duplicación precios</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="detail-card">
                            <div class="detail-value gold" id="dailyLoss">€0.94</div>
                            <div class="detail-label">Pérdida diaria</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="result-chart">
                        <canvas id="inflationChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FACTS -->
    <section class="facts-section animate-in delay-4">
        <div class="section-label">¿Sabías que...?</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Datos sobre la inflación</h2>
        <div class="facts-grid">
            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-icon">💸</div>
                <div class="fact-text">
                    <h4>El dinero se devalúa cada día</h4>
                    <p>Con una inflación del 4%, tu dinero pierde un 0.011% de valor cada día. En un año, lo que costaba 100€ costará 104€.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-icon">📉</div>
                <div class="fact-text">
                    <h4>Regla del 72</h4>
                    <p>Divide 72 entre la tasa de inflación para saber en cuántos años se duplicarán los precios. Al 4%, en 18 años.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-icon">🏦</div>
                <div class="fact-text">
                    <h4>El ahorro tradicional pierde</h4>
                    <p>Si tu cuenta remunerada da el 1% y la inflación es del 4%, tu retorno real es del -3%. Estás perdiendo dinero.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="fact-card">
                <div class="fact-icon">📊</div>
                <div class="fact-text">
                    <h4>Inflación media de la UE</h4>
                    <p>La inflación media en la Eurozona durante los últimos 30 años ha sido del ~2.2%. En España, ligeramente superior.</p>
